# Macros are the system ones (and, later, those of macro libraries);
# any other name with the macro mark is an error (MC8 row 14).
== SOURCE
"a" x_yz< "b"
== ERROR
error[unknown-macro]: there is no macro x_yz<; the system macros are u_se<, i_f<, u_nless<, e_ach<, l_ine<, f_ile<, i_nclude<, c_fg<, e_rror<, d_bg<, a_ssert< and f_ormat< at 4..9
